{"id":"u-41b262d5-365e-4f69-9157-e05f57fa312e","src":"community","title":"Jackson's Bootcamp","author":"Jackson E.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/KyJf29-jackson-bootcamp","desc":"RULE #1 \n- Every single rep is done slow and controlled. squeeze every muscle when you feel a stretch, keep the tension going throughout the whole exercise. \nRULE #2\n- If the exercise is only 2 sets, that means your weight should be HEAVY. push yourself. I only put 2 sets so you can maximize your energy input and lift like a DAWG. If you feel like you can go for more than the reps I wrote... then that means your weight isn't HEAVY ENOUGH. \nRULE #3\n- Never go into a workout thinking it's going to be easy, or that it's a game. The only fun part should be setting new pr's and lifting heavy. If you're going to play around and go to the gym for socializing, then this ISN'T for YOU.\nRULE #4\n- Motivation won't get you far, it's the drive and determination that will bring you to new heights.\nRule #5\n- your Diet is the number 1 thing. Stop snacking on unnecessary things and start eating 3-4 REAL meals a day. Don't make excuses.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Women's","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":2,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-07-10T01:45:42.829Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["push","pull","legs pt.1","upper","legs pt.2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":7},{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":6}]},{"n":"Chest Fly (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Shoulder Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":5,"rpeHi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Kickback","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"amrap":1,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Neutral Grip)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest S